{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-00649-00001","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":4,"evidence":["다스 소유권 문제를 말하면서","검찰은 잘 알지도 못하는 사람들을 불러 목적에 짜 맞춘 진술을 끌어냈다","총 징역 23년과 벌금 320억원, 추징금 163억여원"],"reason":"The summary keeps the main claims: the assertion of innocence, the framing of the investigation as an attack on the whole government, the criticism of prosecutors, and the sentencing request. It leaves out the denial of the bribery charges. The sentence about DAS is slightly compressed, but its meaning is still understandable."},"B":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":3,"evidence":["삼성으로부터 뇌물을 받았다는 혐의와 이팔성 전 우리금융 회장으로부터 뇌물을 받았다는 혐의 등도 모두 부인했다","검찰은 이 전 대통령에게 총 징역 23년"],"reason":"The last sentence attaches the denials to the prosecution as its subject. As written, it reads as if prosecutors both requested the sentence and denied the charges. It also turns the bribery allegations into 'Lee Geon-hee pardon suspicions', which distorts them. The quote about the case being decided earlier is accurate."},"C":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":3,"utility":4,"evidence":["삼성으로부터 뇌물을 받았다는 혐의","한 손을 크게 흔드는 제스쳐"],"reason":"It covers the main claim, the denial of the bribery charges, and the sentencing request accurately. It spends space on a minor gesture detail. The wording in places is awkward or redundant."},"D":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":2,"utility":2,"evidence":["검찰 수사 과정이 부당하다고 언급하며","총 징역 23년과 벌금 320억원"],"reason":"The first two sentences repeat the same content. The summary leaves out the bribery denials and the DAS defense. The sentencing request is accurate."}}}
